mods: fw-glow
timeout: 90s
hide: false
# Glow from DATA (no mod DLL, no harness `glow` directive): mods/fw-glow appends FwGlowRat, a Rat variant whose
# passives grant the status FwGlow_ff00ff on spawn (StatusOnSpawnIn). The framework recognises the status NAME in its
# apply_status hook and asks the glow engine for a magenta rim (docs/data-mods.md "Asking for a unit glow from data").
# editor/scripts/unit-glow-probe.ts --data (`npm run test:unitglow -- --data`) runs this and measures magenta in the
# two shots (glow-measure.ts): "glow" must add a connected magenta patch the pre-spawn "noglow" shot lacks.
wait frames 120
seed 42
enter TacticsTest
wait frames 60
shot "noglow"
cmd spawn FwGlowRat
expect console "Spawned FwGlowRat" within 10
wait frames 60
dump
expect status FwGlow_ff00ff on "Lil' Rat"
shot "glow"
quit
